OL,3,GNEWSAMinute's applause for lifelong
OL,4,ACoventry City fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minute's applause is to be held at
OL,7,FCoventry City's match against Hull City
OL,8,Fin memory of 27-year-old Harry
OL,9,FChattaway, who died suddenly.
OL,11,FThe applause has been organised by
OL,12,FHarry's friend, Ryan Jones, who said he
OL,13,Fis "heartbroken" that Harry will never
OL,14,Fget to see the Sky Blues in the Premier
OL,15,FLeague, as the club returns to the
OL,16,Ftop-flight this season after 25 years
OL,17,Faway.
OL,19,FJones has encouraged supporters to join
OL,20,Fin with the applause in the 27th minute
OL,21,Fof the match on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
