OL,3,GNEWSAMinute's applause for lifelong
OL,4,ACoventry City fan
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Harry was a massive Coventry City fan,
OL,7,Fa season ticket holder, and I think
OL,8,Fthis would be the best send-off he
OL,9,Fcould probably have," Jones added.
